		(property "Design Notes" "VOUT = VREF x (1 + R15/R16) with FB divider R15 40.2k / R16 10k (VOUT = 5.02 V), C31 feed-forward; RT = R14 12.1k; EN = AUX_EN (Pi 3V3 through D15, 100k pull-down R43, force-on jumper J22); RBOOT shorted to CBOOT; SW pin left NC; PG open-drain, unused; VLDOIN tied to VOUT; VCC has an internal 1 uF and must not be loaded (SLVSGB4B pin table), so it is left NC; C30 is the VLDOIN capacitor"
