		(property "Description" "Single-bit dual-supply translator for the servo bus. A side +3V3 (MCU), B side +5V_SYS (servo bus). DIR high = A to B (transmit), low = B to A (receive). If either supply is off both ports are high-impedance, so a live servo cannot back-power the MCU."
