		(property "Design Notes" "VOUT = VREF x (1 + R4/R5) with FB divider R4 41.2k / R5 10k (VOUT = 5.12 V for the Pi 5), C10 feed-forward; RT = R2 12.1k; EN tied to VIN; RBOOT shorted to CBOOT; SW pin left NC; PG open-drain, unused; VLDOIN tied to VOUT; VCC has an internal 1 uF and must not be loaded (SLVSGB4B pin table), so it is left NC; C9 is the VLDOIN capacitor"
