		(property "Description" "5 A very-fast SMD fuse (Littelfuse NANO2 451) on the servo battery feed. HTS-30HS stall is 3.2 A at 12 V (about 3 A at the external buck's input). No SMD PTC exists at >= 3.5 A hold and >= 24 V, so this is a replaceable fuse, not a resettable one."
