		(property "Description" "Motor 1 driver control to Cytron MDD20A (20 A, 6-30 V, 2-channel): 1 = PWM1 speed (PA6, TIM3_CH1, max 20 kHz), 2 = DIR1 direction (PB0), 3 = GND through PTC F10 (signal reference only; the motor current must return on the MDD20A's own battery leads). MDD20A logic: low <= 0.8 V, high >= 1.5 V, so 3.3 V drive is fine. Datasheet: https://cdn.robotshop.com/media/c/cyt/rb-cyt-287/pdf/cytron-20a-6v-30v-dual-dc-motor-driver-datasheet.pdf"
